    {
      "id": "W7xcaMgzlPDpOCr7-Sb9f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 295.52326474537335,
      "y": 1191.0726844269793,
      "width": 770.5914306640625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1332358710,
      "version": 101,
      "versionNonce": 1695126326,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794259881390,
      "created": 1794259537971,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The hybrid takes the best of both. A central, durable counter, such as a Postgres sequence or ZooKeeper,\ndoesn't hand out single IDs. It leases ranges. Each app server asks for a block, say one million IDs from one\nbillion to one billion plus a million. The server converts that block to base-62 codes and shuffles them in\nmemory. After that, creating a short URL is just popping the next code off the shuffled list. There's no\ndatabase lookup, no collision check and no network call on the hot path.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The hybrid takes the best of both. A central, durable counter, such as a Postgres sequence or ZooKeeper, doesn't hand out single IDs. It leases ranges. Each app server asks for a block, say one million IDs from one billion to one billion plus a million. The server converts that block to base-62 codes and shuffles them in memory. After that, creating a short URL is just popping the next code off the shuffled list. There's no database lookup, no collision check and no network call on the hot path.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gsjdraG-qijPAOs-kcfKA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1107.035110214039,
      "y": 1210.3269557083324,
      "width": 531.2315063476562,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ak",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1158045430,
      "version": 82,
      "versionNonce": 1676683126,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794259618268,
      "created": 1794259571660,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Central counter (ZooKeeper, PostgreSQL sequence) pre-allocates batches",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Central counter (ZooKeeper, PostgreSQL sequence) pre-allocates batches",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bW5h3lqQFfNAg2xBYbiuT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1107.8968900022485,
      "y": 1238.4968169970953,
      "width": 282.7037353515625,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1011594090,
      "version": 116,
      "versionNonce": 516781110,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794259612534,
      "created": 1794259571660,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Each worker gets range: [1B, 1B+1M]",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Each worker gets range: [1B, 1B+1M]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zjHcsalfs0h0u0tj3c4sL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1104.1591432389082,
      "y": 1271.0905715630706,
      "width": 388.15966796875,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1175130166,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 1266478838,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794259611028,
      "created": 1794259571660,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Worker converts IDs to base-62 and shuffles locally",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Worker converts IDs to base-62 and shuffles locally",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "N2Iv_qMi1-rqneHSR7h6w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 301.82630221132615,
      "y": 1144.621832029989,
      "width": 479.48760986328125,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 538819702,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 1092527926,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794259887915,
      "created": 1794259881927,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Write Service app node starts up (or exhausts its current range).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Write Service app node starts up (or exhausts its current range).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gS2eVZmEMcZWxYVWguBC5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 295.2080159637899,
      "y": 1170.8776022572213,
      "width": 782.559326171875,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1191374314,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 1753940086,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794259884277,
      "created": 1794259881929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. It calls the central counter directly — a ZooKeeper node or Postgres sequence (fetch_range_from_zk(), line\n409/415) — and gets back a range like [1B, 1B+1M).",
      "fontSize": 16,
